      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2011 Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We describe three Belgian families with a L1436P mutation in the SCN4A gene, causing a sodium channel myotonia with an atypical clinical presentation, characterized by late onset painful cold-aggravated myotonia. These families represent a distinct phenotype within the spectrum of sodium channel myotonia."
      },
